Westpac (`wbc`), Westpac Legacy (`wbcLegacy`), STG, BSA and BOM provide light and dark tokens. Web dark mode is opt-in via the `data-theme` attribute. Use `data-brand="wbc"` and `@westpac/style-config/themes/wbc` for the refreshed Westpac appearance, or `data-brand="wbcLegacy"` and `@westpac/style-config/themes/wbcLegacy` for the previous appearance. The public `wbc26` identifier is no longer supported.

Set `data-theme="dark"` on the same element as `data-brand`. Without this explicit selection, tokens stay light even when the browser or operating system prefers dark mode. Applications own theme selection and persistence; GEL does not automatically follow `prefers-color-scheme`.

Available theme values:

- light (default)
- dark

```html
<StaticCode language="jsx" code={`
<div data-brand="wbc" data-theme="dark">
  <!-- Your app content -->
</div>
`} />
```
